# Pairs with LockStep. The code before #6205 was fixed:
# AuthorizedMetaTool re-runs only the authorizer, so a caller whose every
# grant was revoked after tools/list keeps reading the region topology for
# the rest of its session.
MODULE: RegionsSkipsGrantRecheck
TARGET: LockStep
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: lattice_list_regions does not re-check that the caller still holds a facade grant
PERTURBS: CallRegions

--- FIND
        held == AccessGroups(policy, c) # {}
--- REPLACE
        held == TRUE
--- END